'''Mega Baa Baa''' (メガメェメェ, ''Mega Me~e Me~e'', '''Mega Mee Mee''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]]/[[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] variant of [[Baa Baa]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]] and [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 3's [[Zombie Outbreaks]]. It was added in [[Version 12.6 Update|Version 12.6]].

