==Enemy==
Mega Baa Baa is a Colossus peon balanced similarly to [[J.J. Jackrabbit]], but with much higher damage. It attacks from 200 range by curling into a ball and rolling into [[Cat Units]], dealing heavy damage distributed equally into three closely-spaced multi-hits with 30 piercing range. While each of these hits is fairly strong to begin with, things have potential to get exponentially worse if you are using [[:Category:Surge Attack Cats|Surge Attackers]], as Mega Baa Baa will retaliate with a [[Surge Attack]] of its own for every Surge that hits it. Besides having relatively low health and range, its main weakness is that it has [[Single Attack]], meaning that it will not push much if many Cat Units are deployed.

At the minimum '''200%''' buff it appears with in Zero Legends, Mega Baa Baa has '''96,000''' HP and '''78,000''' total damage ('''26,000''' per hit).

==Strategy==
Being an enemy with Single Attack, meatshielding is heavily recommended as Mega Baa Baa's high damage can cripple your attackers, especially with its [[Multi-Hit]]. Using Surge Attackers such as [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Doron]] will result in your non-[[:Category:Cats with Surge Immunity|Surge-immune units]] taking a heavy amount of damage. It's advised to defeat it as quickly as possible to avoid bringing devastation to your attackers.

Because the majority of its offense come from its Single Attack and Multi-Hits, [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]] can be used to absorb all three of its hits, shielding more fragile units in the process.

