==Trivia==
*Mega Baa Baa's attack animation may be a reference to the Pokémon [[bulbapedia:Wooloo (Pokémon)|Wooloo]] or the [[wgg:eldenring:Ram|sheep]] from ''Elden Ring'', both of which can avoid danger by curling into a ball and rolling.
*In most versions, this enemy's name is just [[Baa Baa]]'s with "Mega" in front, but in the Taiwanese version, the prefix used instead of "Mega" or any equivalent is 機械 ''jīxiè'', meaning machine. The translator may have mistaken メガ ''mega'' for メカ ''meka'' (machine).
*Mega Baa Baa may have been created specifically for [[Warlock and Pierre (Uber Rare Cat)|Mad Doctor Klay]]'s Target [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]], Immune to [[Surge Attack|Surge]] and Colossus Slayer Ultra [[Talents]] (or vice-versa), which were added in [[Version 12.6 Update|Version 12.6]] alongside Mega Baa Baa.
**Klay is a mad scientist, while Mega Baa Baa became a [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] through a mad science experiment.

